# Firmware blobs for server NICs / HBAs.
#
# Deliberately NOT firmware-linux-nonfree: it is only a metapackage that pulls
# firmware-amd-graphics (hundreds of MB of GPU firmware a headless appliance
# never loads).  The RAID controllers and NICs in the fleet keep their firmware
# in on-card flash; firmware-misc-nonfree covers the remaining cases (Intel ice
# DDP, Netronome, Tehuti, ...).
#
# --profile full adds firmware-qlogic / -bnx2 / -bnx2x / -netxen / -myricom /
# -cavium through the generated list (see tools/drivers.py).
firmware-linux-free
firmware-misc-nonfree
